      "motion_no": 1,
      "section": "CALL TO ORDER",
      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "A motion was made by Planning Commission Member Casey to forward a positive recommendation to the City Council for the zone change for the St George Downtown Hyatt as presented. Including the staff recommendations that the height is increased to allow the additional height, as requested by the applicant and shown in the staff report. The applicant must combine the lots the site can be approved. And that a 15 foot landscape strip must be provided along the right of way on 600 East. And also that the use list be changed to only include Bar Establishment, Restaurant, Hotel/Motel.",
      "motion_type": "Land-Use/Zoning",
      "result": "Positive recommendation 6:0",
